diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index da8e7baf..f3140015 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -20,7 +20,7 @@ All notable changes to Industrial Chemical Engineering (IChemE, formerly CreateC
 - Pipeline Check Valve accessory for straight pipes: aim-directed arrows fitted to the casting facets, queued empty-hand direction reversal, permanent one-way transport that survives solid-closure reopening, and survival installation/recovery without replacing pipe identity/settings; checkpoint 18 / storage-unit 11 requires a fresh world (commits `4e5c504d`, `9ffb294f`, batch: `2026-10-24-pipeline-check-valve`).
 - Pipeline Shutoff Valve accessory for straight pipes: scalable flanged ball-valve housing and quarter-turn lever, empty-hand open/close controls, axis-locked mechanical joints and queued hydraulic isolation/reopening that preserves pipe identity and equipment contents; checkpoint 17 / storage-unit 10 requires a fresh world (commit `4dd96fde`, batch: `2026-10-23-pipeline-shutoff-valve`).
 - Fluid Void displays accepted incoming fluid/solid composition; Fluid Generators gain a persistent On/Off switch, place Off and show feed phase ratios; shared fluid equipment screens switch all flow rates and suction-flow inputs between seconds and hours, and reservoirs show current/maximum volume (commits `0f208c52`, `89168361`, batch: `2026-10-23-fluid-device-controls-display`).
-- Constructed pump and compressor suction/discharge connections gain scalable, word-free flow arrows on the adjoining pipe section only, aligned with each port's actual role, with no duplicate equipment-side marking (commits `07e45392`, `e612cff3`, batch: `2026-10-23-mover-port-markings`).
+- Constructed pump and compressor suction/discharge connections gain scalable, word-free flow arrows aligned with each port's actual role (commits `07e45392`, `e612cff3`, batch: `2026-10-23-mover-port-markings`).
 - Constructed centrifugal pumps and reciprocating/centrifugal compressors gain persistent On/Off controls, retaining setpoints while Off closes flow, plus requested positional running audio and matching animation state; one-block devices keep their behavior, and checkpoint 15 / storage-unit 8 requires a fresh world (commits `4b4634f1`, `6e5c07e9`, batch: `2026-10-23-pump-compressor-switch-sound`).
 - Pipeline Sight Glass accessory for existing straight pipe sections: scalable cast housing with recessed round windows facing the installing player, passing-liquid colour and multiphase turbidity, requested display updates, survival recovery and automatic removal when a pipe becomes a corner or junction (commits `465f8af8`, `e1bffe54`, `065683c6`, batch: `2026-10-23-pipeline-sight-glass`).
 - Constructed centrifugal pumps and reciprocating/centrifugal compressors now operate through their suction/discharge nozzles with existing self-powered flow/pressure controls, phase protections, equipment GUI/datasheet access and persistent settings; fluid checkpoint 14 / storage-unit format 7 requires a fresh world (commit `4e96e8ab`, batch: `2026-10-23-functional-pumps-compressors`).
@@ -28,6 +28,8 @@ All notable changes to Industrial Chemical Engineering (IChemE, formerly CreateC
 
 ### Fixed
 
+- Move constructed pump/compressor flow arrows onto equipment nozzle necks behind their connection flanges; remove redundant inner pump flanges and pipe-side arrow metadata while preserving connection positions and check-valve markings (batch: `2026-10-24-mover-equipment-arrows`).
+
 - Keep a carried mover-limit rate result's phase basis with its flow/head guesses, resolving WTI pump-rate convergence holds; report accepted pump pressure/suction limits, inlet refusals and blocked forward flow through the normal equipment error status while retaining genuine solver failures (commits `9fa53354`, `c49f6654`, `98f3dce3`, batch: `2026-10-24-wti-pumping-rate-hold`).
 - Preserve accepted pressure-valve modes between implicit substeps, resolving spurious closure and convergence failures at equal-setpoint two-phase drum outlets while retaining the existing valve laws and conservation checks (commit `83e88bd0`, batch: `2026-10-23-valve-regime-convergence`).
 - Incompatible fluid checkpoint, pack or storage-unit versions now reset the simulation and rebuild placed pipes and complete equipment on chunk load, discarding fluid inventories/settings/pending edits instead of crashing world startup; current-format data still validates strictly (commit `49e57860`, batch: `2026-10-23-fluid-format-reset`).
